{"lines": [{"text": "Forty-two billion dollars left this bank in one single day.", "start": 0.1, "end": 3.892, "spec": {"type": "hero", "title": ["$42 BILLION", "GONE IN ONE DAY"], "mood": "tense"}, "words": [["Forty-two", 0.123, 0.525], ["billion", 0.536, 0.915], ["dollars", 0.915, 1.35], ["left", 1.362, 1.663], ["this", 1.674, 1.842], ["bank", 1.841, 2.243], ["in", 2.478, 2.623], ["one", 2.623, 2.868], ["single", 2.868, 3.114], ["day", 3.114, 3.471]]}, {"text": "It was Silicon Valley Bank in California, the go-to bank for tech startups.", "start": 4.092, "end": 8.652, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [-98, 39, 2.0], "cam2": [-121.5, 37.0, 10], "pins": [{"at": [-121.96, 37.35], "label": "Silicon Valley Bank", "col": "red", "delay": 0.45}]}, "words": [["It", 0.08, 0.136], ["was", 0.148, 0.261], ["Silicon", 0.273, 0.693], ["Valley", 0.693, 1.034], ["Bank", 1.045, 1.375], ["in", 1.5, 1.602], ["California", 1.602, 2.261], ["the", 2.614, 2.705], ["go-to", 2.705, 2.977], ["bank", 2.977, 3.25], ["for", 3.25, 3.364], ["tech", 3.375, 3.591], ["startups", 3.602, 4.227]]}, {"text": "On March eighth, twenty twenty-three, it admitted a one-point-eight-billion-dollar loss on its bonds.", "start": 8.852, "end": 14.516, "spec": {"type": "loss"}, "words": [["On", 0.08, 0.182], ["March", 0.182, 0.455], ["eighth", 0.455, 0.841], ["twenty", 0.989, 1.216], ["twenty-three", 1.216, 1.818], ["it", 2.227, 2.307], ["admitted", 2.307, 2.636], ["a", 2.636, 2.705], ["one-point-eight-billion-dollar", 2.716, 4.182], ["loss", 4.182, 4.591], ["on", 4.602, 4.705], ["its", 4.705, 4.784], ["bonds", 4.784, 5.33]]}, {"text": "Founders panicked in group chats, and everyone pulled their money out with a few taps on their phones.", "start": 14.716, "end": 20.092, "spec": {"type": "panic"}, "words": [["Founders", 0.125, 0.523], ["panicked", 0.534, 0.92], ["in", 0.932, 1.0], ["group", 1.0, 1.307], ["chats", 1.307, 1.807], ["and", 2.023, 2.205], ["everyone", 2.216, 2.693], ["pulled", 2.705, 2.932], ["their", 2.932, 3.034], ["money", 3.034, 3.364], ["out", 3.375, 3.58], ["with", 3.58, 3.682], ["a", 3.682, 3.716], ["few", 3.716, 3.989], ["taps", 3.989, 4.318], ["on", 4.33, 4.398], ["their", 4.398, 4.489], ["phones", 4.489, 5.034]]}, {"text": "By the next morning, another hundred billion dollars was lined up to leave. That's eighty-one percent of all deposits.", "start": 20.292, "end": 26.772, "spec": {"type": "queue"}, "words": [["By", 0.091, 0.148], ["the", 0.148, 0.205], ["next", 0.216, 0.443], ["morning", 0.443, 0.852], ["another", 1.114, 1.409], ["hundred", 1.409, 1.67], ["billion", 1.682, 1.977], ["dollars", 1.977, 2.364], ["was", 2.375, 2.5], ["lined", 2.511, 2.784], ["up", 2.784, 2.875], ["to", 2.875, 2.966], ["leave", 2.966, 3.432], ["That's", 3.795, 3.977], ["eighty-one", 4.114, 4.432], ["percent", 4.443, 4.943], ["of", 5.102, 5.205], ["all", 5.295, 5.432], ["deposits", 5.443, 6.125]]}, {"text": "So regulators shut the bank down, less than two days after the bad news.", "start": 26.972, "end": 31.292, "spec": {"type": "closed", "cut": true}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.273], ["regulators", 0.284, 0.852], ["shut", 0.989, 1.182], ["the", 1.182, 1.261], ["bank", 1.273, 1.545], ["down", 1.557, 1.875], ["less", 2.25, 2.398], ["than", 2.409, 2.534], ["two", 2.534, 2.727], ["days", 2.727, 3.102], ["after", 3.102, 3.284], ["the", 3.284, 3.341], ["bad", 3.352, 3.568], ["news", 3.568, 3.989]]}, {"text": "And about eighty-six percent of the money was above the insured limit of two hundred fifty thousand dollars.", "start": 31.492, "end": 37.108, "spec": {"type": "pie"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.148], ["about", 0.148, 0.398], ["eighty-six", 0.534, 0.966], ["percent", 0.977, 1.273], ["of", 1.284, 1.318], ["the", 1.318, 1.364], ["money", 1.364, 1.67], ["was", 1.875, 2.023], ["above", 2.023, 2.398], ["the", 2.398, 2.455], ["insured", 2.466, 3.011], ["limit", 3.011, 3.375], ["of", 3.489, 3.625], ["two", 3.705, 3.92], ["hundred", 3.932, 4.148], ["fifty", 4.148, 4.432], ["thousand"